abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code and supporting workflows for anatomy-referenced
  transcriptomic benchmarking of human dermal papilla cell-state recovery,
  including strict-rescue analysis, native-fidelity scoring, programme
  definition, sensitivity analyses, donor-aware association testing,
  donor-blocked nested cross-validation, and figure generation.
